# Product Requirements Document (PRD)

## Product Name

VIVO V70 – User Authentication & Dashboard Management System

## Product Version

V1.0

## Prepared By

Sanjeev Kumar Thakur

## Date

June 11, 2026

---

# 1. Product Overview

VIVO V70 is a web-based application that provides secure user authentication, dashboard management, user profile administration, reporting, notifications, and account management functionalities. The platform enables users to securely access personalized dashboards, manage account information, view reports, and perform business-related activities through a centralized interface.

The system focuses on usability, security, performance, scalability, and reliability while providing a seamless user experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.

---

# 2. Business Objectives

## Primary Goals

* Provide secure user authentication.
* Improve user engagement through personalized dashboards.
* Enable users to manage their profiles efficiently.
* Deliver real-time business insights and reports.
* Reduce manual operational effort.
* Ensure high application availability.
* Improve customer satisfaction and retention.

## Business Benefits

* Increased customer engagement.
* Improved operational efficiency.
* Enhanced security and compliance.
* Better decision-making through analytics.
* Reduced support tickets.

## Stakeholders

* Business Owners
* Product Managers
* Customers
* Administrators
* Support Team
* QA Team
* Development Team
* Security Team

---

# 3. Target Users

## Primary Users

* Registered Customers
