# 8. Non-Functional Requirements

## Performance

* Login response less than 2 seconds.
* Dashboard load less than 3 seconds.
* Report generation less than 5 seconds.

## Security

* Password Encryption
* HTTPS
* Session Timeout
* Role-Based Access Control
* Multi-Factor Authentication

## Reliability

* 99.9% Uptime

## Scalability

* Support 100,000+ concurrent users.

## Availability

* 24x7 Access

## Compatibility

* Chrome
* Firefox
* Edge
* Safari

## Mobile Compatibility

* Android
* iOS
* Tablet Devices

